      "data": {
        "text": "\"Create score_image_safety.py in the current working directory.\nTask: checks an image for unsafe or policy-sensitive visual content.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bbf52855001KXGuQrMUQxQmcC",
