      "data": {
        "text": "**Selecting Image Description**\n\nI've decided to move forward with a cloud-based AI service for generating image descriptions. This approach seems the most appropriate for this task. I need to figure out which provider I'll be using.\n\n\n**Defining Provider Selection**\n\nNow, I'm leaning toward Google Cloud Vision AI. The choice feels right for image description. I must incorporate provider-specific signals within the `describe_image.py` script. The goal is to build a solid function for creating the descriptions using the external service.\n\n\n",
